Models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are included in this repository. The on-device defaults are
pinned in `Sources/AII/Core/Models/AIIModels.swift`, downloaded from the Hugging
Face Hub on first use, and carry their own licences:

- Embeddings: `rao-studios/voyage-4-nano-mlx-8bit`, Rao Studios' MLX conversion of
  voyage-4-nano (Copyright (c) 2026 MongoDB, Inc.; built on Qwen 3, Copyright
  (c) 2024-2025 Alibaba Cloud), Apache License 2.0. The repository carries the
  licence and the upstream NOTICE with Rao Studios' statement of the changes.
- General models and graph extraction: `mlx-community/Ministral-3-8B-Instruct-2512-4bit`,
  `mlx-community/Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407-4bit` and
  `mlx-community/Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506-4bit`, MLX conversions of
  Mistral AI's models, Apache License 2.0.
- Vision: `rao-studios/Ministral-3-8B-Instruct-2512-mlx-8bit`, Rao Studios' MLX
  conversion of Mistral AI's Ministral 3 8B, Apache License 2.0.
- Coding: `rao-studios/Qwen3-Coder-Next-REAP-48B-A3B-mlx-4bit`, Rao Studios'
  byte-identical mirror of andosen's MLX conversion of the REAP-pruned
  Qwen3-Coder-Next (Qwen team), Apache License 2.0.

The Mistral API backends (`mistral-embed`, `mistral-tiny` and the chat models)
are a third-party hosted service governed by Mistral's terms.
